cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use UDeep or the UDeep Figure Profile, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "UDeep: Ultra Deep Range scientific figures and the UDeep Figure Profile"
abstract: >-
  UDeep writes scientific figures that are the ordinary figure on every screen and show the
  range above a declared, data-justified knee on HDR displays. It is the reference implementation
  of the UDeep Figure Profile, a draft, data-first specification for turning measurements
  into light.
authors:
  - family-names: Newman
    given-names: Mathew
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1784-3250"
version: 0.3.0.dev0
license:
